### Atelier Quiz Game Backend — HTTP Request Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@adminKey = atelier-secret-admin-key

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Sectors Catalog (Knowledge Domains & Breakdowns)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sectors

### 3. Generate New Questions on Demand (No manual add/edit needed!)
# Sector: CA (Chartered Accountancy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sectors/CA/generate?count=3

### 4. Sector: Healthcare
GET {{baseUrl}}/sectors/Healthcare/generate?count=3

### 5. Sector: Programming
GET {{baseUrl}}/sectors/Programming/generate?count=3

### 6. Sector: Agriculture
GET {{baseUrl}}/sectors/Agriculture/generate?count=3

### 7. Sector: Biology
GET {{baseUrl}}/sectors/Biology/generate?count=3

### 8. Generate Questions via POST Payload (Any Sector)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sector": "Healthcare",
  "count": 5,
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "persist": true
}

### 9. Bulk Generate Across ALL 5 Sectors in One Call
POST {{baseUrl}}/sectors/generate-all
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countPerSector": 3,
  "persist": true
}

### 10. Practice Micro-Quiz Question (Masked, zero answer leak)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/practice?category=Biology&difficulty=medium

### 11. Practice Question Answer Verification (With visual effect directive)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/practice/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": 1,
  "selectedIndex": 0
}

### 12. Start Game Session (With category/count options & dynamic question refresh)
# @name startSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Alex",
  "category": "CA",
  "count": 5
}

### 6. Inspect Player History (Track seen questions for refresh)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/history?playerName=Alex

### 7. Reset Player Question History
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/reset-history
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Alex"
}

### 8. Get Current Question (Masked - No answer fields)
# Run request #2 first to populate sessionId
@sessionId = {{startSession.response.body.sessionId}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/question

### 4. Submit Answer (Question 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": 1,
  "selectedIndex": 1
}

### 5. Check Current Session State
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### 6. Get Summary (Only available after completing all 30 questions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/summary

### 7. Leaderboard (Top 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard

###############################################################################
# ADMIN QUESTION MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS (Header: x-admin-key)
###############################################################################

### 8. Admin: Get Stats & Distribution Warnings
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

### 9. Admin: List All Questions (with filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions?category=HTML&active=true
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

### 10. Admin: Get Single Question by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/1
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

### 11. Admin: Add New Question (ID auto-assigned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "HTML",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "question": "Which HTML element represents an abbreviation or acronym?",
  "options": [
    "<abbr>",
    "<acronym>",
    "<short>",
    "<summary>"
  ],
  "correctIndex": 0,
  "explanation": "The <abbr> tag represents an abbreviation or acronym, with the optional title attribute providing the expansion.",
  "active": true
}

### 12. Admin: Partial Update (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/1
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "difficulty": "easy"
}

### 13. Admin: Soft Delete Question (Safe: blocked if active < 30 unless ?force=true)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/31
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

### 14. Admin: Restore Deactivated Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/31/restore
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

### 15. Admin: Export Entire Question Bank
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/export
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

### 16. Admin: Bulk Add Questions (All-or-Nothing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/bulk
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "category": "CSS",
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "question": "Which CSS property specifies how flex items are laid out along the cross axis?",
    "options": [
      "justify-content",
      "align-items",
      "flex-direction",
      "flex-flow"
    ],
    "correctIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "align-items governs alignment on the cross axis, while justify-content operates on the main axis.",
    "active": true
  }
]
